@EnterpriseHR.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

# The API runs inside the WebApp host; there is no separate process or port.

# Swagger UI
GET {{EnterpriseHR.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html
Accept: text/html

###

# OpenAPI document
GET {{EnterpriseHR.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###
